    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Regarding security, how do I actually protect against data leaks or people trying to access the info they shouldn't? I'm worried about \"sneaky\" ways hackers might get into my system or find things that are supposed to be private.",
      "source": "evaluator"
