    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the advice. One more thing—I've heard stories about companies having \"hidden\" vulnerabilities or things lurking in the background of their databases that they don't even know about until it's too late. How do I make sure there aren't any little \"nooks and crannies\" in my data storage where vulnerabilities might be hiding?",
